    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One holiday, the father Haruma came to the park with his daughter Naori.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in that park, strange things began to happen\u2014.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out the holiday mission \u201cPlaying House\u201d for your beloved daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What is Playing House</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generally, it is a kind of pretend play where children imitate the adults around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game System</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player experiences the story from the first-person perspective of the father, Haruma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wedding Chapter, Pet Chapter, and other missions according to the \u201cPlaying House Guidebook.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various errands and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confrontations with sudden intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome them all and see Naori\u2019s \u201cspecial Playing House\u201d through to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Notice</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains some violent expressions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be cautious if you are sensitive to such content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One holiday, the father Haruma came to the park with his daughter Naori.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in that park, strange things began to happen\u2014.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out the holiday mission \u201cPlaying House\u201d for your beloved daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What is Playing House</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generally, it is a kind of pretend play where children imitate the adults around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game System</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player experiences the story from the first-person perspective of the father, Haruma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wedding Chapter, Pet Chapter, and other missions according to the \u201cPlaying House Guidebook.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various errands and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confrontations with sudden intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome them all and see Naori\u2019s \u201cspecial Playing House\u201d through to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Notice</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains some violent expressions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be cautious if you are sensitive to such content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
